	Annotation {
	  Name			  "Input Capture and Change Notification block measures pulses from the RC receiver\nPulses have a period of"
	  " 20ms and a duty cycle between 1ms and 2ms. 1.5ms is the middle value (0)\n2ms correspond to the max value IC1max ("
	  "check workspace)\nWe remove 1.5ms convert the internal representation of the result so has to obtain an output in ["
	  "-1000 +1000]\nNote that the conversion use the Store Integer method (SI) that require no calculation (fast)"
	  Position		  [328, 48]
	}
      }
